WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:01.920
- [Kelly] How are the
comedy shows going though?

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.790
- Pretty good.

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.623
- Yeah?

00:00:03.623 --> 00:00:05.760
- I mean, the crowds are back. It's nice.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:06.593
- It's fun. The energy.

00:00:06.593 --> 00:00:07.426
- Ya know. Yeah.

00:00:07.426 --> 00:00:08.610
I've been doing a lot of improv

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.350
and that's the nicest because

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.150
you don't have to prepare anything.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.130
- I love improv. I love watching it.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:14.963
- Would you ever do it?

00:00:14.963 --> 00:00:16.680
- I don't know, but I
think I would do that

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:17.513
before anything else.

00:00:17.513 --> 00:00:18.346
- [Nicole] Do you want to?

00:00:18.346 --> 00:00:19.800
Because I can get, I could hook you up.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.810
- [Kelly] I would, I would maybe try it.

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:21.643
(audience applauds)

00:00:21.643 --> 00:00:22.476
I think it would be fun.

00:00:22.476 --> 00:00:23.309
- Would you?

00:00:23.309 --> 00:00:24.810
- I think it would be fun.

00:00:24.810 --> 00:00:26.400
I like acting on stage.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.007
Like I grew up in musical
theater- like theater,

00:00:28.007 --> 00:00:28.840
- [Nicole] Mm-hmm.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.630
- and I like doing it the one time

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.030
and you're in the mode, like at that's

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.020
- This is one time

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.386
and you never do it again.

00:00:35.386 --> 00:00:36.855
- [Kelly] I know. So it's fun that way

00:00:36.855 --> 00:00:38.790
- [Nicole] There's someone
else on stage to be like,

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:41.100
Hey friend, let's do something else.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.140
- [Kelly] But even if
it's bad, it's funny.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:43.980
- I think so

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.813
- Yes.

00:00:44.813 --> 00:00:45.960
- Okay. Kelly, I'm holding you to this.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.250
You're willing to do
an improv show with me?

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.404
- [Kelly] I'm going to be
like nervous but I would do it

00:00:49.404 --> 00:00:50.237
- [Nicole] Really?

00:00:50.237 --> 00:00:52.037
- Just for fun. Just for
like, I've never done

00:00:52.037 --> 00:00:53.906
- Well, I mean, you're
not doing it for money.

00:00:53.906 --> 00:00:54.739
(laughing)

00:00:54.739 --> 00:00:55.572
- [Kelly] No, no. I just, mean, no

00:00:55.572 --> 00:00:57.416
- Nobody gets paid to do
improv. It's all imaginary.

00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:58.332
(laughing)

00:00:58.332 --> 00:00:59.165
- [Kelly] I didn't mean

00:00:59.165 --> 00:01:00.327
- This is me paying you for improv.

00:01:00.327 --> 00:01:02.610
- [Kelly] No, I meant,
I meant like I've never

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.025
done anything like that.

00:01:04.025 --> 00:01:04.858
- This is exciting

00:01:04.858 --> 00:01:05.820
- Other than like in in
high school doing stuff

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:07.020
- Yeah. I'm gonna hold you to this.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:07.853
- [Kelly] So who do you do this?

00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:08.760
Do you do this with friends?

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.260
- I do it with friends lately.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:13.140
Seth Rogan has joined the show that I do.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:13.973
Yeah there's,

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:15.240
- [Kelly] He was just on here.

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.712
I'll tell you what I did
not realize about him.

00:01:17.712 --> 00:01:19.980
I knew he had a great laugh

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:23.130
but like it is the most infectious

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:25.710
and like you end up laughing
so much at his laugh.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:26.730
You can't stop.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:27.600
- Yeah. On stage.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.083
Sometimes you'll like
get into a giggle fit

00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:30.900
because you'll hear his
giggle and you're like,

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:31.733
oh I am being funny.

00:01:31.733 --> 00:01:33.990
- [Kelly] Oh my God. And he and his laugh,

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:35.640
I've never heard anything like it.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:36.473
- It's great.

00:01:36.473 --> 00:01:37.890
- So you do it with
friends whenever you're,

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.960
you're up there. So that's
kind of, that's comfortable.

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:41.430
- [Nicole] Yeah. We do
kinda feed off each other.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:42.750
It's called the Last Improv Show.

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:43.740
It's like twice a month.

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.403
Honestly. I'm gonna get you to do it.

00:01:45.403 --> 00:01:46.290
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.430
- I think you're gonna have fun.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.780
- [Kelly] Okay. I say yes to things

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:49.621
now that I never, well like this show

00:01:49.621 --> 00:01:50.850
(laughter)

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:52.619
and I never would've said yes to before.

00:01:52.619 --> 00:01:53.771
- Yeah sure, I'll host a show

00:01:53.771 --> 00:01:54.604
- Even if I fail,

00:01:54.604 --> 00:01:55.691
it's when you get older, you don't care.

00:01:55.691 --> 00:01:57.222
So you, I actually don't know

00:01:57.222 --> 00:01:59.373
that I care in my twenties either.

